    {
      "Action": "EditData",
      "Target": "Data/NPCGiftTastes",
      "Entries": {
        "Sable": "Oh. Where did you find this? I'm keeping it somewhere the light can't fade it.$h/395 66 62 64 402 611 595/That's lovely. Thank you, really.$0/330 80 205 -80 -79/...I'll find a use for it. Probably.$u/178 92 167/No. Absolutely not. Take it back before it touches anything.$a/766 154 420/Thanks. I'll put it on the shelf with the other mysteries.$0/"
